    "detailed_description": "The official version of the domestic single-player game &quot;Guilty: Ashlar&quot; is about to be released on Steam!<br />\r\nSteam Store Interface: https://store.steampowered.com/app/2553800/_/<br />\r\nAbout the game:<br />\r\n1. This is a single-player role-playing game of adventure puzzle genre, players will adventure step by step in the dark fantasy world and uncover the truth of this world.<br />\r\n2. The promotion of the game mainly relies on &quot;grid exploration + event interaction + concise combat performance&quot; as the core gameplay, and creates an overall game atmosphere with a style similar to &quot;dark dungeon&quot;;<br />\r\n3. The event interaction mainly uses text prompts + selection feedback as the main interaction of the game, so it only needs the mouse to operate easily;<br />\r\n4. In order to facilitate adventure and exploration, the game adopts a vertical screen for display (small map and large map are displayed up and down), only mouse operation is required to play, the content includes: no less than 30 hours (if you are not a skilled hand, it may reach 40+50 hours) of main story content and 2 additional modes (quasi-random nature);<br />\r\nLevels: Nearly 600 large and small maps are available to explore;<br />\r\nEnemies: There are more than 1,000 types of different enemies;<br />\r\nIf you like this type of game, you might as well add Guilt: Ashlar to your wishlist!!<br />\r\nQQ official group: 342110943<br />\r\nBilibili: https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eu411w7RM/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=933d7eb3ed809c521bcdc0abae4f8612",
